  "title": "Best Apple Crisp Ever",
  "description": "A no-fuss, very delicious version of apple crisp, sliced apples, sugar, cinnamon and flour are stirred together and then piled into a square baking pan. Melted butter and a beaten egg, mixed with a flour, sugar and cinnamon mixture are spread over the top and the Best Apple Crisp Ever is baked in the oven until bubbly and crisp.",
  "authors": [
